              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The mahout is unarmed; the two crew have hand weapon and javelins. A third crewman may be added (+9). The elephant may be fitted with a howdah (+6) and shields may be attached to the outside (+1 per crewman). The howdah provides a 5+ save increased to 4+ by adding shields. Only one elephant may be fielded in armies in Italy.</characteristic>
